Description: A chess simulator built as the final project for Advanced
    Programming in R (WNE UW). Demonstrates four advanced R techniques:
    R6 object-oriented programming with inheritance and polymorphism;
    Rcpp/C++ integration for performance-critical minimax search with
    alpha-beta pruning; an interactive 'shiny' dashboard for playing
    games and running tournaments; and standard R package structure
    with 'roxygen2' documentation.
